{
  "scene_id": "051_arrival_in_fire",
  "description": "BOOK 9 - CHAPTER 49 ARRIVAL IN FIRE",
  "entities": [
    {
      "id": "geralt",
      "name": "Geralt",
      "health": 100.0,
      "max_health": 100.0,
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      },
      "type": "character"
    }
  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 28,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Another insertion!\"",
        "line": 43
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 30,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"WE'RE HERE FOR THE SPIRE!\"",
        "line": 46
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 32,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Liar! Everyone wants the spire! For conquest! For fire!\"",
        "line": 49
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 35,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"NOW, LUMINAIRE!\"",
        "line": 54
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 41,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You... you're with the Spire? Not just another scavenger?\"",
        "line": 63
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 42,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We're here for Aetheric Coil.\"",
        "line": 65
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 55,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Commander,\"",
        "line": 83
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 82,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Anchor. Luminaire. HELP.\"",
        "line": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 84,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The planet's core temperature is rising. The magma arteries are blocked. I regulate the thermal flow, but the blockage\u2014I can't reach it. If I leave this chamber, even for a moment, the planetary systems I'm manually stabilizing collapse immediately. I am trapped. The war outside damages the crust faster than I can compensate. I am... failing.\"",
        "line": 124
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 89,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Something is consuming the excess thermal flow,\"",
        "line": 133
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 124,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You're... the Anchor?\"",
        "line": 179
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 129,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I've been using shadow-paths to evacuate wounded from the front lines. Walking the spire's energy currents without knowing what they were.\"",
        "line": 187
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 131,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You navigate collapsed spaces,\"",
        "line": 190
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 136,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we need you.\"",
        "line": 197
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 139,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I'm already standing on the planet's arteries,\"",
        "line": 202
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 159,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThe planet\u2019s thermal regulation is blocked,\u201d",
        "line": 233
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 175,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWhat comes through those rifts,\u201d",
        "line": 252
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 182,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWe\u2019ll deal with what comes through later,\u201d",
        "line": 262
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 190,
      "actor": "Nyxthoria",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cUse it well, Anchor,\u201d",
        "line": 273
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 203,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWe do,\u201d",
        "line": 292
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 204,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cYou understand what it is?\u201d",
        "line": 294
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 214,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThree hundred years. Perhaps four.\u201d",
        "line": 307
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 215,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cAnd if the planet\u2019s core regulation fails? How much time does everything lose?\u201d",
        "line": 309
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 220,
      "actor": "Zerathune",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cA shorter life on a living world,\u201d",
        "line": 317
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 230,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cDo not let my sacrifice be for cinders,\u201d",
        "line": 331
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 237,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cAelxion vouches for you. And you smell of my son\u2019s cause.\u201d",
        "line": 343
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 239,
      "actor": "Geralt",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWe need it to reignite the core\u2019s flow after we clear the blockage,\u201d",
        "line": 346
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 248,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWe\u2019re asking you,\u201d",
        "line": 358
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 252,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cYou are not my son,\u201d",
        "line": 364
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 258,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cTake it. Restart the heart. I will fight my war with tooth and claw and rage. It will have to be enough.\u201d",
        "line": 372
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 276,
      "actor": "Oreck",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThen we dig,\u201d",
        "line": 397
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 277,
      "actor": "Luminaire",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cI cannot follow you,\u201d",
        "line": 399
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 303,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Left here,\"",
        "line": 438
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 318,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Something down here is\u2026 wrong,\"",
        "line": 459
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 378,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The heart!\"",
        "line": 543
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 402,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"RUN!\"",
        "line": 580
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 423,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The planet will survive,\"",
        "line": 610
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 431,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The worm's death bought us time,\"",
        "line": 621
      }
    }
  ],
